{"id":"15c083801acd41a1","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-qml-formula.md","title":"Quantified Modal Language","display":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-qml-formula","aliases":["89-df-qml-formula"],"display":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-qml-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-qml-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qml-formula — Quantified Modal Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>，各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> 有互异 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元谓词字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^{(k)}\">\\(P_i^{(k)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 允许。变量、谓词标签与逻辑构造子两两不交，构造子自由生成。</li>\n<li>没有项函数、常元或等号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FV}_Q,\\mathrm{FV}_Q\">\\(\\mathsf{FV}_Q,\\mathrm{FV}_Q\\)</span> 不另作两个接口，下面统一使用原有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_Q\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pred}\\)</span> 记录谓词字母，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 只记录盒深度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_Q\">\\(g_Q\\)</span> 使用本书已固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,\\mathsf{seq}\">\\(\\pi,\\mathsf{seq}\\)</span>，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\)</span> 上的限制沿用原有句子编码接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_j=v_{h_j}\">\\(x_j=v_{h_j}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\Box,\\exists\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\Box,\\exists\\)</span> 是原始逻辑构造子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{x_j\\mid j&lt;k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_Q(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Pred}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{P_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Pred}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(B)),\\quad\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\Box A)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\ng_Q(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\ng_Q(P_i^{(k)}(v_{h_0},\\ldots,v_{h_{k-1}}))\\coloneqq6\\pi(\\pi(k,i),\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle h_j\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle))+1,\\\\\ng_Q(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+2,\\quad\ng_Q(A\\land B)\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_Q(A),g_Q(B))+3,\\\\\ng_Q(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+4,\\quad\ng_Q(\\exists v_i A)\\coloneqq6\\pi(i,g_Q(A))+5,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Code}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Fml}_Q],\\quad\\mathsf{SentCode}_Q\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_Q],\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\\forall x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\neg A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{x_j\\mid j&lt;k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_Q(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Pred}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{P_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Pred}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(B)),\\quad\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\Box A)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\ng_Q(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\ng_Q(P_i^{(k)}(v_{h_0},\\ldots,v_{h_{k-1}}))\\coloneqq6\\pi(\\pi(k,i),\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle h_j\\mid j&lt;k\\rangle))+1,\\\\\ng_Q(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+2,\\quad\ng_Q(A\\land B)\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_Q(A),g_Q(B))+3,\\\\\ng_Q(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+4,\\quad\ng_Q(\\exists v_i A)\\coloneqq6\\pi(i,g_Q(A))+5,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Code}_Q&amp;\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Fml}_Q],\\quad\\mathsf{SentCode}_Q\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_Q],\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\\forall x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\neg A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 17 章，印刷页 219–220；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n采用与原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box\\)</span> 等价的联结词基础。盒不是变量绑定子：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\)</span>，不能把开放盒子公式误当作句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FV}_Q,\\mathrm{FV}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"g_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi,\\mathsf{seq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"x_j=v_{h_j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\Box,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}qml\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nQ_0&\\coloneqq\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\n\\{P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\mid i,k\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\},\\\\\nQ_{n+1}&\\coloneqq Q_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A,\\exists xA\\mid A\\in Q_n,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in Q_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_Q&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}Q_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sent}_Q\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_Q\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{x_j\\mid j<k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_Q(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Pred}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq\\{P_i^{(k)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pred}(\\neg A)&=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{Pred}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Pred}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Pred}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{Pred}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(P_i^{(k)}(\\vec x))\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&=\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\exists x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq\\max(\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(B)),\\quad\n\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(\\Box A)\\coloneqq1+\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}(A),\\\\\ng_Q(\\bot)&\\coloneqq0,\\quad\ng_Q(P_i^{(k)}(v_{h_0},\\ldots,v_{h_{k-1}}))\\coloneqq6\\pi(\\pi(k,i),\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle h_j\\mid j<k\\rangle))+1,\\\\\ng_Q(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+2,\\quad\ng_Q(A\\land B)\\coloneqq6\\pi(g_Q(A),g_Q(B))+3,\\\\\ng_Q(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq6g_Q(A)+4,\\quad\ng_Q(\\exists v_i A)\\coloneqq6\\pi(i,g_Q(A))+5,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Code}_Q&\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Fml}_Q],\\quad\\mathsf{SentCode}_Q\\coloneqq g_Q[\\mathrm{Sent}_Q],\\\\\nA\\lor B&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\\forall x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\exists x\\neg A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot,\\to,\\exists,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_Q(\\Box A)=\\mathrm{FV}_Q(A)","display":false}],"bytes":3313,"backlinks":[{"id":"7691d5ec76419b08","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pred}$ 和 $\\mathrm{depth}_{\\Box}$ 取 [[89-df-qml-formula]] 的完整结构递归；没有把量词深度混入盒深度。"},{"id":"ee07d81809d76030","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce269af4e544b5ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$g_Q$ 是 [[89-df-qml-formula]] 的编码；$S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_Q$。$\\mathrm{Pred}(S)$ 有限。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-qml-formula]] → [[89-df-open-provability-formula]] → [[89-df-qml-realization]] → [[89-df-qml-validity-sets]] → [[89-df-relative-completeness]] → [[89-thm-qml-complexity]] → [[89-cor-qml-not-axiomatizable]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7","0d71e87a2f416230"]}